---
description: Summarize open requests in the {{team.name}} ticket queue.
parameters:
  team: context-types/team.contexttype.tfer
requiresServers:
  - servers/helio-tickets.server.tfer
copilot:
  argumentHint: "[age filter]"
---
Summarize open requests in the {{team.queue}} queue for {{team.name}}. Group
them by age, and call out anything that would block a {{team.tier}}-tier
release. Read tickets through the helio-tickets server; never change them.
